OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree dispute must be
OL,4,A'contained' - UUP leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoliticians should make a "collective
OL,7,Fappeal to contain" the parading dispute
OL,8,Fin Drumcree, according to the Ulster
OL,9,FUnionist Party (UUP) leader.
OL,11,FJon Burrows called on other parties to
OL,12,Fjoin him in emphasising the need to
OL,13,F"resolve the dispute and not multiply
OL,14,Fit".
OL,16,FIt is the twelfth day of deadlock
OL,17,Fbetween residents of the Garvaghy Road
OL,18,Fand the local district lodge of the
OL,19,FOrange Order over the proposed march in
OL,20,FPortadown, County Armagh.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
