OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree dispute must be
OL,4,A'contained' - UUP leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, a representative for the
OL,7,FGarvaghy Road Residents Coalition
OL,8,F(GRRC) said the disagreement was "no
OL,9,Flonger just about the Garvaghy Road"
OL,10,Fafter a meeting with 11 other
OL,11,Fnationalist residents' groups.
